<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Brokerage on Lionel Blog</title><link>https://hybridego.github.io/tags/brokerage/</link><description>Recent content in Brokerage on Lionel Blog</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>ko-KR</language><lastBuildDate>Sun, 13 Sep 2026 08:45:00 +0900</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://hybridego.github.io/tags/brokerage/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>키움증권·Interactive Brokers: 같은 거래활동 수혜인데 3개월 성적은 왜 갈렸나</title><link>https://hybridego.github.io/2026/06/09/stock-candidate-note-brokerage-trading-platforms/</link><pubDate>Tue, 09 Jun 2026 08:30:00 +0900</pubDate><guid>https://hybridego.github.io/2026/06/09/stock-candidate-note-brokerage-trading-platforms/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="키움증권interactive-brokers-같은-거래활동-수혜인데-3개월-성적은-왜-갈렸나"&gt;키움증권·Interactive Brokers: 같은 거래활동 수혜인데 3개월 성적은 왜 갈렸나&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;이 글의 한국 시세는 네이버 증권 모바일 API의 2026-06-09 08:32 KST 장전 표시가, 미국 시세는 StockAnalysis의 2026-06-05 종가를 기준으로 한다. 9월 13일에는 키움증권 2분기 공시, Interactive Brokers 2분기 실적과 8월 월간 지표, 9월 11일 종가를 붙여 3개월 점검을 더했다.&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;주요 출처: &lt;a href="https://biz.chosun.com/en/en-finance/2026/06/03/3J2MEUFKSBB3POZMKYQD4YKWVQ/?outputType=amp"&gt;ChosunBiz - KOSPI 상승 속 증권주 후행&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://koreajoongangdaily.joins.com/news/2026-05-12/business/finance/Mirae-Asset-becomes-first-Korean-brokerage-to-post-over-1-trillion-won-in-quarterly-profit/2590417"&gt;Korea JoongAng Daily - 국내 증권사 1분기 실적&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://en.sedaily.com/finance/2026/04/30/kiwoom-securities-q1-net-profit-doubles-to-4774-billion-won"&gt;Seoul Economic Daily - 키움증권 1분기 실적&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://www.businesswire.com/news/home/20260421110584/en/Interactive-Brokers-Group-Announces-1Q2026-Results"&gt;Interactive Brokers 1Q26 실적&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://www.businesswire.com/news/home/20260601110544/en/Interactive-Brokers-Group-Reports-Brokerage-Metrics-and-Other-Financial-Information-for-May-2026-includes-Reg.-NMS-Execution-Statistics"&gt;Interactive Brokers 2026년 5월 월간 지표&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://investors.robinhood.com/news-releases/news-release-details/robinhood-markets-inc-reports-april-2026-operating-data"&gt;Robinhood 2026년 4월 월간 지표&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://content.schwab.com/web/retail/public/about-schwab/schwab_q1_2026_earnings_release.pdf"&gt;Charles Schwab 1Q26 실적 자료&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://stockanalysis.com/stocks/ibkr/history/"&gt;StockAnalysis - IBKR 가격&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://stockanalysis.com/stocks/hood/history/"&gt;StockAnalysis - HOOD 가격&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://www.financecharts.com/stocks/SCHW/summary/price"&gt;FinanceCharts - SCHW 가격&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://www.yonhapnewstv.co.kr/news/AKR20260730081331F92"&gt;연합뉴스TV - 키움증권 2분기 영업이익 93% 증가&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://www.mt.co.kr/stock/2026/07/30/2026073014024471130"&gt;머니투데이 - 키움증권 2Q 당기순익 6,806억원&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://www.investchosun.com/site/data/html_dir/2026/08/03/2026080380048.html"&gt;인베스트조선 - 키움증권 목표가 잇단 하향&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://www.inews24.com/view/2000484"&gt;아이뉴스24 - 키움증권 개인 거래대금 급감·점유율 하락&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://ndcdyn.interactivebrokers.com/mkt/getFileNew.php?file=2026Q2_Earnings_Release.pdf"&gt;Interactive Brokers 2Q2026 실적&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://www.interactivebrokers.com/mkt/getFileNew.php?file=latestMetricPR"&gt;Interactive Brokers 2026년 8월 월간 지표&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://finance.naver.com/item/main.naver?code=039490"&gt;네이버 금융 키움증권&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/IBKR/"&gt;Yahoo Finance - IBKR&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;blockquote&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;이 글은 투자 추천이 아니라 공개자료로 남기는 후보 선별 기록이다. 증권주는 시장이 뜨거울 때 가장 쉬워 보이지만 실제로는 거래대금 둔화와 신용 리스크가 같이 따라온다.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>